      <h1>About SmartCheck</h1>
      <p>SmartCheck exists to answer one question quickly: will this smart home device actually work with the hub or ecosystem you already own?</p>
      <p>Smart home compatibility is more confusing than it should be. A device might say "works with Alexa" on the box but still need an extra bridge, a separate app, or a firmware update before it actually connects. We go through manufacturer documentation and connection specs for each device-and-hub pairing and lay out plainly what you can expect.</p>
      <p>We update entries as manufacturers roll out new firmware and as the Matter smart home standard adds native support to more devices — so a "not compatible" result today may change down the road.</p>
      <p>SmartCheck is reader-supported. When you buy through some of our links, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This never affects which devices we list or how we describe their compatibility. Read more in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>Spotted an error, or want us to add a device? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
